AFFIDAVIT

I, Mr. Vijay Singh, S/o Gopal Singh, aged 42 years,
residing at 7, Sector 4, Hiran Magri, Udaipur – 313 001,
Site Engineer, M/s. Rajputana Builders Pvt. Ltd.,
do hereby solemnly affirm and state as follows:

1. I am the Site Engineer for the Hospital Construction Project at Udaipur under Work Order
   No. RMSCL/2024-25/Works/4782 and am fully conversant with the facts stated herein.

2. I was present at the site continuously from 10.05.2024 onwards and have personal knowledge
   of all site activities and RMSCL's actions/inactions.

3. Regarding the structural drawings for Block C: The drawings were received from RMSCL only
   on 28.12.2025, despite repeated written requests starting from 01.10.2025. This caused a
   complete work stoppage for 88 days.

4. I personally visited the RMSCL office on 15.10.2025, 01.11.2025, and 20.11.2025 to request
   the drawings. Each time, I was told that the drawings were "under revision" and would be
   provided "shortly".

5. The delay in drawings directly affected:
   - Tower crane remained idle (daily hire cost: ₹25,000)
   - 25 steel fabricators remained idle (daily wage cost: ₹75,000)
   - Concrete pump and associated equipment remained idle
   - Progress target for Block C missed by 88 days

6. All Variation Orders (VO-01 to VO-11) were issued by the Engineer-in-Charge verbally during
   site visits, and I have recorded these in my site diary entries dated 01.08.2024 to 15.12.2025.

7. Regarding running bills: RA Bills No. 3 to 9 were submitted on time and certified by the
   Junior Engineer. However, payment was not released despite certification. The certification
   copies are available with the office.

8. All facts stated above are within my personal knowledge and are true to the best of my
   information and belief. No part of it is false and nothing material has been concealed.

Deponent: Vijay Singh
Date: 01.03.2026
Place: Udaipur

Sworn before me:
Oath Commissioner / Notary Public